#: ../../source/docs/common-training-centers.rst:60
#: 1e6c0e06a1da4ceb9aed4eafe5e0c39c
msgid "**Description:** four courses:"
msgstr "**课程：** 四门课程："

#: ../../source/docs/common-training-centers.rst:58
#: b6c6faa8e1a84b07994bf7821edd912a
msgid ""
"Intro to RPAS (history, applications, and regulations leading to the FAA "
"part 107 certificate), Lab: build and fly RC airplane, program and drive "
"APM:Rover"
msgstr ""
"遥控航空器系统入门（历史、应用和法规，引导至 FAA Part 107 证书），实验：搭建并飞行 RC 飞机，编程并驾驶 APM:Rover"

#: ../../source/docs/common-training-centers.rst:59
#: a1a1d620495742ad8287d3d46ec60fa7
msgid ""
"RPAS Operations (system architecture, control theory, and operational "
"considerations), Lab: flight training with APM:Copter and APM:Plane"
msgstr "遥控航空器系统操作（系统架构、控制理论和操作考量），实验：使用 APM:Copter 和 APM:Plane 进行飞行训练"

#: ../../source/docs/common-training-centers.rst:60
#: 500c562489d74004927444ae87c8ec60
msgid ""
"Flight Control Systems (systems engineering: discussion of robotic flight "
"control and payload integration, MavLink UDP), Lab: ArduPilot test and "
"integration into new airframes; advanced payload integration"
msgstr ""
"飞控系统（系统工程：讨论机器人飞行控制和有效载荷集成、MavLink UDP），实验：将 ArduPilot 测试并集成到新机架；高级有效载荷集成"

#: ../../source/docs/common-training-centers.rst:61
#: 1c971e3c8977439f9591654635634525
msgid ""
"Operations in the National Airspace System (real-world application of prior "
"courses; data management/processing/analysis, geotagging, etc), Lab: use of "
"ArduPilot vehicles used in prior courses to pursue data collection projects "
"that benefit the community"
msgstr ""
"国家空域系统运营（前期课程的实际应用；数据管理/处理/分析、地理标记等），实验：使用前期课程中的 ArduPilot 飞行器开展有益于社区的数据采集项目"

#: ../../source/docs/common-training-centers.rst:62
